  "description": "U-Jin Cha wants his backpacking trip through Europe to be exciting—and maybe even a little bit spicy! Instead, his hotel reservation gets canceled, and it’s pouring rain. To make matters worse, the only person around to help him is Seung-Hyeok, his year-long crush he’s trying to forget! Despite U-Jin’s initial reluctance, one night as Seung-Hyeok’s roommate turns into another... and another. This definitely isn’t the trip U-Jin had in mind, but he’s starting to wonder, is it really that bad?\n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes 24 side story chapters.*",
